1
00:00:00,900 --> 00:00:04,300
Humans! Tomorrow I'm going to the North Pole.

2
00:00:05,400 --> 00:00:11,000
This is Galleta. He spent his first Christmas shaking under a car.

3
00:00:11,900 --> 00:00:17,000
And I found out that Santa never brings gifts to street animals.

4
00:00:18,600 --> 00:00:23,700
So I'm going to ask him in person. Every animal deserves a gift.

5
00:00:26,800 --> 00:00:30,200
Galleta is coming with me. He just doesn't know it yet.

6
00:00:32,100 --> 00:00:38,800
Our vehicle: my sleigh. Well... it's my bed. But it's shaped like a sleigh.

7
00:00:39,900 --> 00:00:45,400
Tell me in the comments which street animal deserves a gift. Liftoff!

8
00:00:49,400 --> 00:00:52,600
I think... I don't know how to drive this.

9
00:01:04,300 --> 00:01:06,400
And you... who are you?
